🤖 Prompt for AI Agents
Verify each finding against current code. Fix only still-valid issues, skip the
rest with a brief reason, keep changes minimal, and validate.

In `@server/public/model/command_response.go` around lines 85 - 88, The length
check currently uses len(o.Text) which counts bytes; change it to count
characters by using utf8.RuneCountInString(o.Text) (or len([]rune(o.Text))) when
comparing to maxLength, update the import to include "unicode/utf8", and keep
the same error return (the check lives in CommandResponse.IsValid referencing
o.Text and maxLength); if the 65,535 constraint is actually a byte-storage
limit, leave the current byte-based len() check instead.




